    "updated_at": "2026-09-21T17:03:04Z",
    "body": "On disabled the picker:\n\n| Element | Chrome | Firefox | Chrome on Android | Firefox on Android |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `<input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"email\">` | Close | Close | Close | — |\n| `<input list=\"datalist\">` | Close | Close | Close | — |\n| `<input type=\"date\">` | Stay open | Stay open | Stay open, don't save | Stay open |\n| `<input type=\"datetime-local\">` | Stay open | Stay open | Close | Stay open |\n| `<input type=\"month\">` | Stay open | Stay open | Close | Stay open |\n| `<input type=\"week\">` | Stay open | Stay open | Close | Stay open |\n| `<input type=\"time\">` | Stay open | Stay open | Close | Stay open |\n| `<input type=\"color\">` | Stay open | Stay open | Stay open, don't save | Stay open |\n| `<input type=\"file\">` | Stay open | Stay open | Stay open | Stay open |\n| `<select>` | Close | Close | Close | Stay open, don't save |\n| `<select multiple size=\"1\">` | Stay open, non-interactive | — | Close | Stay open, don't save |\n| `<select class=\"base-picker\">` | Stay open, non-interactive | Stay open, non-interactive | Stay open, non-interactive | Stay open, non-interactive |\n| `<select multiple size=\"1\" class=\"base-picker\">` | Stay open, non-interactive | — | Stay open, non-interactive | — |\n\n```css\n.base-picker,.base-picker::picker(select) {\n\tappearance: base-select;\n}\n```\nTest page: https://codepen.io/sb3nder/full/bNpwZjX",
    "author_association": "NONE",
