    "updated_at": "2026-09-21T17:26:22Z",
    "body": "| Element | Safari on IOS |\n|---|---|\n| `<input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"email\">` | — |\n| `<input list=\"datalist\">` | Close |\n| `<input type=\"date\">` | Close |\n| `<input type=\"datetime-local\">` | Close |\n| `<input type=\"month\">` | Close |\n| `<input type=\"week\">` | Close |\n| `<input type=\"time\">` | Close |\n| `<input type=\"color\">` | Close if not using eyedropper, don't save |\n| `<input type=\"file\">` | Stay open |\n| `<select>` | Close | Close | Close | Stay open, don't save |\n| `<select multiple size=\"1\">` | Close |\n| `<select class=\"base-picker\">` | — |\n| `<select multiple size=\"1\" class=\"base-picker\">` | — |\n",
